5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m worried about guessing the fee again. Last time we just picked a number and hoped. Who actually knows what we can count on?,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,The evenings feel heavy lately. People hesitate before coming. I want to understand why belonging feels like a calculation now.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Takumi,,It’s the same twelve faces doing everything. Others pay the same but never show up. I want to see who’s actually carrying the weight.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The treasurer role is burning people out. I need to know what we’re really asking of the next person before we pick a system.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Newcomers used to drift in easily. Now it feels rigid. I want to make sure whatever we choose doesn’t scare people away.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, if the job is too hard, people quit. That’s bad for everyone. We need a system that’s easy to run.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, ease is good, but if people feel pressured, they stop coming. We need to protect the quiet ones.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, quiet ones are fine if they don’t have to do the work. I just want the work distributed fairly.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, fairness is key. But if the system is complex, the treasurer drowns. I need to see the actual hours.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Toshio, I agree. If it’s too complicated, new people won’t join. We need something simple and welcoming.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I’ll check the ledger and the bank statements. I need to see where the money actually went and how hard it was to collect.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I’ll look at the weekday turnout and the winter social comments. I need to see how the hesitation is showing up.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I’m checking the sign-in sheets and the rota. I need to prove that the same people are doing all the work.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the treasurer's logged hours and the mid-year joiner records. I need to see the administrative burden.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I’ll check the taster forms and the minute books. I want to see why people don’t join and how the old system felt.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,I’m all set! I’ll check the ledger and the bank statements. Let’s see what the numbers say!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I’ll check the turnout and the social comments. I want to understand the mood.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I’m checking the sheets and the rota. Let’s see who’s really working.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will review the hours and the joiner records. Minimizing burden is essential.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I’ll check the forms and the minutes. Let’s see what people are saying.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
