60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Option A is a flat fee. It’s simple. But if costs rise, we’re stuck. Option C charges per event, which might be fairer but harder to manage.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Option A feels like a tax. Option C made people hesitate before. Option B might let people choose their level, which could help.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"Option A means the same people pay for everyone. Option C charges only those who come, which is fair. Option B is complicated.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option A is the easiest to manage. One collection a year. Option C requires chasing money for every event. Option B is in between.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Kenji,,Option A is simple. Option B lets people choose. Option C might scare people away. I like the idea of choice in B.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, Option A is the easiest for you, right? But what if we run out of money mid-year?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, Option B might help. If people choose a lower level, they pay less. But will they still feel like they belong?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, if they pay less, they do less work. That’s fair. Option C is the fairest, but is it too much work?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, Option C is too much work. Six hours a month is not sustainable. Option A is the only one that protects the treasurer.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Toshio, I agree. But if Option A is too high, people won’t join. Option B might be a middle ground.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,I’m voting for Option A. It’s the simplest and protects the treasurer. We can adjust the fee if needed.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I’m voting for Option B. It gives people a choice and might reduce the hesitation.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Takumi,,"I’m voting for Option C. It’s the fairest. If you don’t come, you don’t pay.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I’m voting for Option A. It minimizes the administrative burden.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I’m voting for Option B. It’s welcoming and gives people a choice.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mio,,I stand by my vote for A. We need stability.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,I stand by my vote for B. We need to protect the quiet ones.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Takumi,,I stand by my vote for C. We need fairness.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Toshio,,I stand by my vote for A. We need sustainability.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Kenji,,I stand by my vote for B. We need to be welcoming.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
